    // `col * (1 + fres*rimBoost) + spec*3`, so `rimBoost` and `sheen` multiply
    // rather than add up — the same trap CONFIG.bubbleShell carries a long note
    // about, where 2.4/0.4/0.92 came out at 26x and clipped to a white blob.
